Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It includes
parts from these projects:

- mods/ram/model.js (the agents, their exit history and the towers' sizes) is
  the model of the Night City layout, and mods/ram/main.js uses it the way
  Night City's mod does. Night City is part of
  https://github.com/vib-z/herdr-layouts, under the MIT License below. This
  copy was changed: room for a floor-number column, and room under the
  towers for their git lines.

- mods/ram/git.js (branch and git counts per space) is ported from the
  spaces mod of the Traveler layout, https://github.com/franky5440-afk/herdr-traveler
  (Copyright 2026 Frank Lin, Apache License 2.0), which is derived from the
  built-in spaces mod of Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app,
  Apache License 2.0). This copy adds each changed file's line counts.

- mods/text-bigger and mods/text-smaller change settings.json the way Herdr's
  own Settings screen does (Herdr, Apache License 2.0).

Everything else (mods/ram/main.js, ui.js, all.js, hunk.js, arrow.svg,
mods/prefix, keys.json, layouts/, themes/, nvim/ and tests/) is new code.

